SUMMARY:5 KM/3 mile Sunday Afternoon Walk in Canton
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nThe start/finish point is
  the parking lot for the Rec Park baseball field (not to be confused with 
 the public-school baseball field next to the football stadium—our meetin
 g place is a little further down the road). The field was destroyed by Hur
 ricane Helene\, but has been rebuilt\, and the parking area is still there
 . Hopefully\, some of the Clyde Elementary School Cardinals Elite Walking 
 Team and their families will be joining us for this event.\n\nWe will star
 t our walk at the Canton Recreation Park\, go through part of downtown\, u
 p Academy Street\, past the historic cemetery and the public library\, pas
 t Pisgah High School\, and back to the start point. The up and down are fa
 irly steep.\n\nDress appropriately for the weather. Tennis shoes are fine.
  This is all pavement\, but some might want walking sticks for the up and 
 down\; I plan to walk with a pair of walking sticks. Bring plenty of water
  and a protein snack. Dogs on leash are welcome.
